  "title": "Elements of Top-Down Design",
  "shortSummary": "介绍 top-down design 的分解思路、抽象层次与逐层细化在软件设计中的作用。",
  "keyTerms": [
    "top-down design",
    "抽象层次",
    "逐层细化",
    "模块分解"
  ],
  "animationType": "none",
